<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12950" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπο-κρῐσλς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>separation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anaxag.
				4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάθαρσις ἀ. χειρόνων ἀπὸ βελτιόνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Def.</u>
					415d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic.,
				<i>excretion</i> or <i>secretion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γονῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Genit.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Vict.</u>
					4.93
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				582a4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				878a23
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ.σπερματική,</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιττωματική,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				681b35
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέρματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Nat.Herc.</u>
					908.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. νοσηρή</span>”
				<i>exhalation, miasma,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Nat.Hom.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (from 
				Med.
			) <i>decision, answer,</i> first in <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				1167
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.50
			</span></i> codd. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόκρισις</span> edd.),
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Decent.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Steril.</u>
				213
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				977
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πρὸς τὸ ἐρώτημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.60
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Hier.</u>
				1.35
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>defence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				5.65
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>rescript,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				2.23
			</span></i>; =
			<i>responsum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>embassy, commission,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Chor.
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rev.Phil.</u>
				1.79
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a kind of
				<i>dance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
